# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# Secrets — never commit the Tushare token / endpoint
.env.local
.env

# Data cache (raw Tushare pulls, parquet) — large, regenerable, not for git
# Anchored to repo root so it does NOT swallow the ashare_gauntlet/data/ source package.
# 2026-08-12 用户决定:data/ 与 docs/ 整目录(个人账户状态、研究方法论与实验档案)
# 一律不入公开仓;勿 `git add -f` 加回。本地文件保留,仅移出版本控制。
/data/
/docs/
*.parquet

# Scratch / smoke scripts
_scratch*
_smoke*

# 年报原文文本 / 关键词提取实验残留(非代码,不入库)
_yake_*.txt

# CodeGraph / Cherry Studio 本地状态与会话附件(可重建/可能含个人内容)
.codegraph/
.cherry-studio/

# OpenHarness 本地配置、凭据与运行态；项目 skills 允许入库
.openharness/*
!.openharness/skills/
!.openharness/skills/**
.openharness/settings.json
.openharness/credentials.json
.openharness/copilot_auth.json
.openharness/data/
.openharness/logs/
.openharness/teams/
.openharness/worktrees/
.openharness/runtime/
.openharness/issue.md
.openharness/pr_comments.md

# Understand Anything 默认不启用；生成物可能包含语义化源码摘要
.ua/
.understand-anything/
